{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22487","headline":"同韩侍郎游郑家池吟诗小饮 · 白居易","name":"同韩侍郎游郑家池吟诗小饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野艇容三人，晚池流浼浼。\n悠然依櫂坐，水思如江海。\n宿雨洗沙尘，晴风荡烟霭。\n残阳上竹树，枝叶生光彩。\n我本偶然来，景物如相待。\n白鸥惊不起，绿芡行堪采。\n齿发虽已衰，性灵未云改。\n逢诗遇杯酒，尚有心情在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}